/.chat-r1/
/.r2/

# Whitepaper + handoff docs + working notes live in the repo for editing
# convenience but are not part of the chain source. Root-anchored so the
# upstream substrate/docs/ tree is unaffected.
/docs/

# The rostro.org marketing site source. Lives in this repo for editing
# but is published from a separate path (GH Pages config / dedicated repo)
# and is not part of the chain build.
/site/